"AKShare will update the code/name, but will not overwrite the existing "
"`industry` and other columns with null values; if Tushare fundamentals have "
"never been written into the library, "
"`refill_data_source(tables='stock_basic', channel='tushare')` is still "
"required before selecting stocks by industry."

